Tools and libraries that are used but not included
  The following are downloaded by the scripts, the package managers or CI, and
  aren't redistributed here. Each has its own license:
    Kaitai Struct compiler 0.11 (GPL-3.0-or-later), used as a build tool
    Kaitai Struct runtimes: kaitaistruct for Python (MIT), kaitai-struct for
      JavaScript (Apache-2.0), io.kaitai:kaitai-struct-runtime for Java (MIT),
      KaitaiStruct.Runtime.CSharp, and the C++/STL and Lua runtimes
    Test dependencies: pytest, JUnit, Jackson, JsonUnit, Hamcrest, Gradle,
      NUnit, GoogleTest, nlohmann/json, luaunit and dkjson
  The Lua runtime, luaunit and dkjson are downloaded into tests/lua/vendor/,
  and the C++ ones into the CMake build directory. Neither location is
  committed.
